---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import MaterialField from './MaterialField.astro';
---
<MaterialField />
<article class="project-stage caldiy-project" aria-labelledby="caldiy-title">
  <div class="project-copy">
    <h2 id="caldiy-title" class="chapter-title" style="view-transition-name: project-caldiy"><a href="/work/caldiy">One slot.<br />Twenty contenders.</a></h2>
    <div class="project-meta"><span>Cal.diy v6.2.0</span><span>Risk-led test strategy</span></div>
    <p>API, timezone, concurrency, and accessibility testing for a self-hosted scheduling system. Documented failures stay in the evidence.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/work/caldiy">Inspect Cal.diy <Icon /></a>
  </div>
  <figure class="contention-figure">
    <div class="contention-bars" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => <span class:list={{ winner: i === 0 }}></span>)}</div>
    <figcaption><strong>1 persisted booking</strong><span>19 expected conflicts in a recorded contention run</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</article>
<article class="project-stage llm-project" aria-labelledby="llm-title">
  <div class="project-copy">
    <h2 id="llm-title" class="chapter-title" style="view-transition-name: project-llm-evaluation"><a href="/work/llm-evaluation">How reliable is<br />the judge?</a></h2>
    <div class="project-meta"><span>Local RAG target</span><span>LLM evaluation</span></div>
    <p>An evaluation harness that checks retrieval, answers, and safety. Its refusal judge remains outside CI gates because the measured evidence has limits.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/work/llm-evaluation">Read the evaluation <Icon /></a>
  </div>
  <figure class="judge-figure">
    <div class="agreement"><span>82<span class="percent">%</span></span><p>raw agreement with<br />45 blind human labels</p></div>
    <div class="agreement-track" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
    <figcaption>The refusal judge remains outside CI gates.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</article>
<section class="archive-link" aria-label="Framework archive">
  <h2 class="chapter-title">Six frameworks.<br />Four testing disciplines.</h2>
  <div class="archive-link-action"><p>Web · API · Mobile · Performance</p><a class="text-link" href="/work">Explore the work archive <Icon /></a></div>
</section>
<style>
  .project-stage { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 9%; align-items: center; min-height: 85svh; padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 9rem) var(--page-gutter); }
  .caldiy-project { background: var(--paper, #e9e0d4); color: #252019; }
  .llm-project { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.9vw, 6rem); line-height: 1.03; }
  .project-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1.5rem; font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .project-copy > p { max-width: 45ch; font-size: 1.075rem; margin-top: 2rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .llm-project .project-copy > p { color: #d5cec4; }
  .text-link { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .caldiy-project .text-link:hover { color: #774000; }
  figure { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
  .contention-figure { overflow: clip; padding-top: 2rem; }
  .contention-bars { display: flex; align-items: end; gap: clamp(3px, .55vw, 9px); height: clamp(9rem, 19vw, 18rem); perspective: 1000px; }
  .contention-bars span { flex: 1; height: 40%; background: #8d8170; transform-origin: bottom; }
  .contention-bars .winner { height: 100%; background: #46301c; }
  figcaption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .judge-figure { overflow: clip; }
  .agreement { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: end; }
  .agreement > span { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 11rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1; color: var(--color-amber); }
  .percent { font-size: .45em; }
  .agreement p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--color-muted); padding-bottom: .6rem; }
  .agreement-track { height: 2px; background: var(--line); margin-top: 2rem; }
  .agreement-track span { display: block; width: 82%; height: 100%; background: var(--color-amber); transform-origin: left; }
  .judge-figure figcaption { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .archive-link { padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem) var(--page-gutter); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 3rem; }
  .archive-link h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 4.4rem); }
  .archive-link-action { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .archive-link-action p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .project-stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; min-height: auto; padding-block: 4rem; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 8.6vw, 3.7rem); }
    .project-copy > p { font-size: 1rem; }
    .project-meta { font-size: .75rem; margin-top: 1.3rem; }
    .contention-bars { height: 10rem; }
    .agreement > span { font-size: clamp(5rem, 24vw, 8rem); }
    .archive-link { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: 2rem; }
    .archive-link-action { flex-shrink: 1; }
  }
</style>
